                                            <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Currently, this resource includes labels and definitions in the following three natural languages: English, Italian, and French. In the next version of this resource, the creator intends to also encompass Italian and French translations of the remaining pieces of information as well as to cover other natural languages."@en ,
