                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> "A quality inheres in its bearer at all times for which the quality exists."@en ;
                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> "is quality of"@en ,
                                                                                         "quality_of"@en ;
