<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002593> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                            rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002497> ;
                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "holds between x and y if and only if the time point at which x ends is equivalent to the time point at which y starts. Formally: iff ω(x) = α(y)." ;
