<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0012014> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                            rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002010> ;
                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "x 'negatively regulates in other organism' y if and only if: (x is the realization of a function to reduce the frequency, rate or extent of y) AND (the agents of x are produced by organism o1 and the agents of y are produced by organism o2)." ;
