   <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PATOC:GVG"
 ] .


###  http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001241
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001241> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                              rdfs:subClassOf <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000019> ,
                                                              <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0000001> ;
