###  http://www.semanticweb.org/Davarpanah-Babaie/ontologies/2021/9/ClimateOnSDG1267#National_Policy
<http://www.semanticweb.org/Davarpanah-Babaie/ontologies/2021/9/ClimateOnSDG1267#National_Policy> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                                                  rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.semanticweb.org/Davarpanah-Babaie/ontologies/2021/9/ClimateOnSDG1267#Policy> ;
                                                                                                  rdfs:comment """ClimOO Ontology comment:
see also http://www.semanticweb.org/Davarpanah-Babaie/ontologies/2021/9/ClimateOnSDG1267#Climate-related_Adaptation_Planning
http://www.semanticweb.org/Davarpanah-Babaie/ontologies/2021/9/ClimateOnSDG1267#National_Planning
 and subclasses.
http://www.semanticweb.org/Davarpanah-Babaie/ontologies/2021/9/ClimateOnSDG1267#Strengthen_Capacity and subclasses.
