Ubbiali, G. A., Borghini, A., & Lange, M. C. (2024). Ontologies for Sustainability: Theoretical Challenges. https://doi.org/10.31219/osf.io/z8uqr"""@en ;
                                       rdfs:label "ambiente del sistema"@it ,
                                                  "environnement de système"@fr ,
                                                  "system environment"@en ;
                                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A material entity that surrounds and is distinct and disjoint from a system."@en ,
                                                                                        "Un'entità materiale che circonda ed è distinta e disgiunta da un sistema."@it ,
                                                                                        "Une entité matérielle qui entourne et qui est distincte et disjointe d’un système."@fr ;
                                       <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/maturity> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/Provisional> .

