                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7073-9172> .


<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002009> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A relation that applies between a cell(c) and a gene(g) , where the process of 'transcription, DNA templated (GO_0006351)' is occuring in in cell c and that process has input gene g." ;
                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7073-9172> .


