                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "c executes activity in d if and only if c enables p and p occurs_in d.  Assuming no action at a distance by gene products, if a gene product enables (is capable of) a process that occurs in some structure, it must have at least some part in that structure." ;
                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165> ;
                                            <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> "executes activity in" ;
