<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002602> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A shortcut relationship between two entities x and y1, such that the intent is that the relationship is functional and inverse function, but there is no guarantee that this property holds." .


<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002603> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "x is approximately equivalent to y if it is the case that x is equivalent, identical or near-equivalent to y" .


