                                            <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> "has divisor" .


<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0040035> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "This relation groups  relations between diseases and any other kind of entity." .


